    <string name="upd_confirm_title">Install firmware %1$s?</string>
    <string name="upd_confirm_body">This replaces firmware %2$s on your unit with %1$s.\n\nNot yet tested on a real unit: TalkCtrl\'s transfer follows Qualcomm\'s standard upgrade protocol as the Cardo app uses it, but it has not been tried on a Cardo unit. The unit verifies Cardo\'s signature and keeps its old firmware until the new one is confirmed, and can resume an interrupted transfer.\n\nKeep the screen on and the unit close until it\'s done.</string>
